sentences.text:
In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner/s are granted the following reliefs: -
1. fair market value @ Rs.17,29,500/- per acre for the acquired land as per statement u/s 19 of the LA Act;
2. additional amount @ 12% per annum on the fair market value u/s 23 (1A) of the LA Act , from the date of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date LAC no. 330/16 page 7 of 8 of award or dispossession, whichever is earlier ;
3. solatium u/s 23 (2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of market value;
4. interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum on the difference between the enhanced compensation awarded by this court and the compensation awarded by the LAC for the subsequent period till its payment.

In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner/s are granted the following reliefs: -
1. fair market value @ Rs.19,80,750/- per acre for category A land and @
Rs.19,31,231/- per acre for category B land for the acquired land, whichever is applicable, as per statement u/s 19 of the LA Act ;
2. additional amount @ 12% per annum on the fair market value u/s 23 (1A) of the LA Act, from the date of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date of award or dispossession, whichever is earlier ;
3. solatium u/s 23(2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of market value ;
4. interest under Section 28 of L.A Act @ 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per annum LAC No.333/19 page 8 of 9 on the difference between the enhanced compensation awarded by this court and the compensation awarded by the LAC for the subsequent period till its payment.

